1997</xref>; <xref ref-type="other" rid="bib45">Harms <italic>et al</italic>, 1999</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Liver tumour</italic></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Metachronous</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><xref ref-type="other" rid="bib96">Sugihara <italic>et al</italic>, 1993</xref>; <xref ref-type="other" rid="bib23">Donato <italic>et al</italic>, 1994</xref>; <xref ref-type="other" rid="bib8">Beckurts <italic>et al</italic>, 1997</xref>; <xref ref-type="other" rid="bib45">Harms <italic>et al</italic>, 1999</xref></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><xref ref-type="other" rid="bib47">Hohenberger <italic>et al</italic>, 1994</xref>; <xref ref-type="other" rid="bib80">Rees <italic>et al</italic>, 1997</xref>; <xref ref-type="other" rid="bib76">Okano <italic>et al</italic>, 2000</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Time interval from primary (months)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><xref ref-type="other" rid="bib47">Hohenberger <italic>et al</italic>, 1994</xref></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003e;12 (<xref ref-type="other" rid="bib33">Fong <italic>et al</italic>, 1999</xref>)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">0&#x02013;3 <italic>vs</italic> &#x02a7e;4 (<xref ref-type="other" rid="bib67">Minagawa <italic>et al</italic>, 2000</xref>)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003e;30 (<xref ref-type="other" rid="bib5